    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well presented three bedroom semi detached home located in the popular Emerald Drive development in Killybegs. This property offers a bright living room to the front, a kitchen and dining area overlooking the rear garden, and three well proportioned bedrooms along with a family bathroom. \n\nThe home is in good condition throughout and provides a comfortable layout ideal for first time buyers, families, or anyone seeking a quality residence in a quiet, established neighbourhood.\n\nThe rear garden is private and easy to maintain, offering a safe space for outdoor enjoyment, while the front of the property includes off street parking. \n\nEmerald Drive is a peaceful residential area within walking distance of schools, shops, the harbour, and all local amenities, making it an excellent location for everyday living. With its strong layout, modern features, and desirable setting, this home represents a superb opportunity in Killybegs."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.1m (13'5\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nWalls painted, Tile flooring, 1no. Window, 1no, Radiator\n\nLiving Room - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nWalls painted, Laminated Flooring, 1no. Bay Window, 1no. Radiator, Solid Fuel Open Fire\n\nKitchen - 6.6m (21'8\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, 2no. Window, 1no. Radiator, High & Low level units tiled between, Wash hand basin, Electric Hob & Oven\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.6m (8'6\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.2m (7'3\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nWalls Tiled, Floors tiled, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Wash hand basin, WC, Corner Shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nWalls painted, Hard wood flooring, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nWalls painted, Hard wood flooring, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.5m (8'2\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nWalls painted, Hard wood flooring, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Built in wardrobe\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
